# Bubblewrap regenerates everything here from twa-manifest.json (npm run apk). The signing key
# (android.keystore) and its passwords (signing.json) are private: back them up, never commit them.
*
!.gitignore
!twa-manifest.json
!assetlinks.json
# The Rover Cockpit app (npm run apk -- --app rover) is generated in rover/; only its manifest is source.
!rover/
rover/*
!rover/twa-manifest.json
